A bare colon run interrupts a paragraph whether or not a line follows it

```
text
not a div
:::
.
<p>text
not a div</p>
<div>

</div>
```

```
- a
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <div>

    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> a
> :::
.
<blockquote>
  <p>a</p>
  <div>

  </div>
</blockquote>
```

```
- a
  :::
y
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <div>

    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>y</p>
```

```
![a](i)
^ cap
:::
.
<figure>
  <img src="i" alt="a">
  <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
</figure>
<div>

</div>
```

```
:::: d
text
:::
.
<div class="d">
  <p>text</p>
  <div>

  </div>
</div>
```

```
::: {.x}
not a div
:::
.
<p>::: {.x}
not a div
:::</p>
```
